  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Giant Sun became venerable through luck path, Heavenly Court’s leader Golden Hooped Great Immortal made a plan and invited him to tour Heavenly Court, telling the world they were inviting Giant Sun to join openly. He personally led Giant Sun through important places, including sites Limitless, Reckless Savage, and Red Lotus had stopped at when they attacked, and did not reject the request to see fate Gu on Heaven Overseeing Tower. After leaving, Giant Sun said he had to reconsider joining. The experience and conversation are recorded in Heavenly Court’s history with great precision.",
      "chapters": [
        1710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_reckless_savage_demon_venerable",
        "gu_fate_gu",
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He wears a golden hoop on his head.",
      "chapters": [
        2270
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "During the fight around Book Mountain and the immortal graveyard, he shouts for Giant Sun Immortal Venerable to come out and meet him. Narration notes he once invited Giant Sun to tour Heavenly Court, and that Giant Sun planted a seed that erupted in the fate war when Longevity Heaven arrived and caused huge losses.",
      "chapters": [
        2181
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "anger-at-giant-sun",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_book_mountain",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable",
        "fac_longevity_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Duke Mei, Duke Tong, and others, he moves forward to block Fang Yuan’s group as they charge the Crazed Demon formation.",
      "chapters": [
        2198
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blocking-the-path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_mei",
        "char_duke_tong",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_crazed_demon_formation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He appears suddenly and tells Immortal Zombie Giant Sun that the killer move is finally complete, blaming him for arranging methods during the guest tour and for Longevity Heaven’s ambush of Heavenly Court headquarters in the fate war. He uses his life and all his cultivation to activate the move. Mysterious light falls on Immortal Zombie Giant Sun’s head and turns into a golden hoop that binds the forehead and leaves mind and body slightly sluggish.",
      "chapters": [
        2200
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "life-cost-golden-hoop",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_immortal_zombie_giant_sun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is one of three rank eight Gu Immortals Star Constellation Immortal Venerable sends with Seven Fiendish Primeval Monarch and Duke Mei to capture Fairy Zi Wei. He frowns when Fairy Zi Wei names Feng Jiu Ge as a Heavenly Court traitor.",
      "chapters": [
        2270
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capture-order",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable",
        "char_seven_fiendish_primeval_monarch",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He then attacks Spectral Soul Demon Venerable alongside the other two rather than striking the Shadow Sect pair first.",
      "chapters": [
        2271
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
